Like all quest nemeses, he will teleport to the stairs to heal.  Also,
all quest nemeses are stoning resistant, so a *trice corpse wouldn't
help anyway.  You have Werebane, which is a silver sabre.  Enchant it
and use it against Nalzok.  He is a demon, and the d20 silver damage
will make him much easier to hit.

Another of my favorite techniques is to use potions of paralysis.  If
you are level 30, and have a high luck, you should be able to lob a
!oP at him from 2 squares away and give yourself a few free attacks. 
Another approach is to put on a ring of free action, wield the potion
and smack Nalzok over the head with it.  Free action will prevent you
from being paralyzed and give you the same benefits as hitting him
from afar.  Just remember to re-wield your sabre.

